         rule because SpecHub spec sheets use positional cell layouts that
         survive only in native xlsx (merged headers, multi-row sub-headers).
         Pin patch version để rebuild deterministic. Pure .NET, no native
         deps, cross-platform; pulls DocumentFormat.OpenXml + ExcelNumberFormat
         + SixLabors.Fonts transitively (~12 MB packages, ~4 MB gzipped). See
         docs/HOW-TO-UPGRADE-TO-SQLSERVER.md + LESSONS_LEARNED.md. -->
    <PackageReference Include="ClosedXML" Version="0.104.2" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\CCL.MES.Domain\CCL.MES.Domain.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\CCL.MES.Application\CCL.MES.Application.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
